msgid "<0>-vat</0> usually names no source and is mostly met in news and reports. In everyday talk people usually say who said it with <1>ütles, et</1>."
msgstr "<0>-vat</0> usually names no source and is mostly met in news and reports. In everyday talk people usually say who said it with <1>ütles, et</1>."

msgid "<0>-vat</0> usually passes the news on without saying who said it."
msgstr "<0>-vat</0> usually passes the news on without saying who said it."

