msgid "After <et>ütles</et> or <et>rääkis</et>, put a comma and <et>et</et>. The person words change with the speaker, and the verb takes the new person’s ending."
msgstr "After <et>ütles</et> or <et>rääkis</et>, put a comma and <et>et</et>. The person words change with the speaker, and the verb takes the new person’s ending."

