msgid "To report what someone said, put a comma and <0>et</0> after <1/> or <2/>, then the sentence itself: <3>Mari ütles: „Ma olen väsinud.“</3> becomes <4>Mari ütles, et ta on väsinud.</4> Mari said she is tired."
msgstr "To report what someone said, put a comma and <0>et</0> after <1/> or <2/>, then the sentence itself: <3>Mari ütles: „Ma olen väsinud.“</3> becomes <4>Mari ütles, et ta on väsinud.</4> Mari said she is tired."

msgid "To report what someone said, put a comma and <0>et</0> after <1>ütles</1> or <2>rääkis</2>. The person words change with the speaker: <3>ma</3> becomes <4>ta</4>, <5>mul</5> becomes <6>tal</6>, and the verb takes the new person’s ending."
msgstr "To report what someone said, put a comma and <0>et</0> after <1>ütles</1> or <2>rääkis</2>. The person words change with the speaker: <3>ma</3> becomes <4>ta</4>, <5>mul</5> becomes <6>tal</6>, and the verb takes the new person’s ending."

